---
title: "Sequence 1: Upload and processing"
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant UI as Web UI (React)
  participant API as API server (FastAPI)
  participant W as Worker process
  participant ASR as CrisperWhisper + FFmpeg
  participant LLM as LLM API
  U->>UI: Drop video + options
  UI->>API: POST /api/jobs
  alt longer than 3 min or too large
    API-->>UI: 422 + reason (inline error)
  else valid
    API-->>UI: 201 job_id, SSE stream opens
    API->>W: dispatch job (queue, 1 at a time)
    W->>ASR: extract audio + 480p preview
    W->>ASR: transcribe (verbatim, word timestamps)
    ASR-->>W: words with start/end
    W->>W: rule engine: repeats, fillers, pauses
    W->>LLM: transcript text only
    alt answer within 30 s
      LLM-->>W: retake ranges
    else timeout or error
      W->>W: WARN log, rules-only cuts
    end
    W-->>API: cuts + spans saved (SQLite)
    API-->>UI: SSE ready
  end
